{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53898","headline":"西明寺合欢牡丹 · 顾非熊","name":"西明寺合欢牡丹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绿茎同本两花莲，似证分身色相圆。\n黄药鬬香欺瑞麦，檀葩幷秀掩嘉莲。\n奏开祥瑞来天使，折去芳枝到御筵。\n想得六宫人尽爱，几多纤指递相传。\n（影印本《诗渊》第四册第二三八○页）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾非熊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53898.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53898","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}